    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420840/extras/78466efeae28b33682942d12a2f5ef9b.avif?t=1743663647\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You need to stay alive in this horror-puzzle adventure.</strong>\u00a0<strong>By mistake, you ended up in a world of outcasts</strong>.\u00a0<strong>People have been living there for years, but no one knows what's going on there. Apparently, there's only one way to find out..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>FIND OUT WHAT HAPPENS ON <i>THE OUTER SIDE</i>:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight monsters and any danger that might find you. Use your abilities and powers to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, and navigate through this endless labyrinth of horrors. As each level has it's own taste.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the truth. Explore this world, find left audio logs, feel the story. As you never know, what might find you next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror is not only about jumpscares, but  the psychology of the character and his inner demons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420840/extras/3433996d9b0321ab1801646eeb83bb59.poster.avif?t=1743663647\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420840/extras/3433996d9b0321ab1801646eeb83bb59.webm?t=1743663647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420840/extras/3433996d9b0321ab1801646eeb83bb59.mp4?t=1743663647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note from the Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made by one person, (hello it's me, aqua). I've spent about 7 months working on this game, while going through a lot in life. Personally, when I was younger, I was a big fan of this style and genre, but I don't see much games like this since.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So with that, I created this project, that really means a lot to me. So if you decide to purchase a copy, thank you. I hope that you'll enjoy this little indie horror I created.</p>",
